# Vercel KV Configuration
# This is automatically set up when you enable Vercel KV in your Vercel project
# No manual configuration needed - Vercel handles this for you!
# 
# Steps to enable Vercel KV:
# 1. Go to your Vercel dashboard
# 2. Select your project
# 3. Go to Storage tab
# 4. Click "Create Database"
# 5. Choose "KV" (or use the Redis integration)
# 6. Follow the prompts
# 7. The environment variables will be automatically set in production
#
# For local development, you can run:
# npm run dev
# Changes will sync when deployed to Vercel

